{
  "info": {
    "name": "Condos API",
    "description": "Sistema de Administración de Condominios — todos los endpoints del backend Spring Boot.\n\n## Cambiar entre Local y Producción\nModifica la variable `baseUrl` en la colección:\n- **Local:** `http://localhost:8080`\n- **Producción:** `https://condoia.onrender.com`\n\n## Uso\n1. Ejecutar primero **Auth / Login Admin** para obtener el token\n2. El token se guarda automáticamente en la variable `adminToken`\n3. Hacer lo mismo con **Login Residente** y **Login Guardia**\n\n## Variables de colección\n- `baseUrl` — apunta a local o prod (cambiar según necesidad)\n- `localUrl` = http://localhost:8080\n- `prodUrl` = https://condoia.onrender.com\n- `adminToken` — se llena automáticamente al hacer login\n- `userToken` — se llena automáticamente al hacer login\n- `guardiaToken` — se llena automáticamente al hacer login",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://condoia.onrender.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "localUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "prodUrl", "value": "https://condoia.onrender.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "guardiaToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "visitaId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "usuarioId", "value": "3", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cuotaId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cuotaUsuarioId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paqueteId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "incidenteId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificacionId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "areaComunId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "reservacionId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.token);",
                  "  console.log('adminToken guardado');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Residente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', json.token);",
                  "  console.log('userToken guardado');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"residente1\",\n  \"password\": \"pass123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Guardia",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('guardiaToken', json.token);",
                  "  console.log('guardiaToken guardado');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"guardia1\",\n  \"password\": \"pass123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (usuario autenticado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
